===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰregʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|drawen}}, {{m|enm|draȝen}}, {{m|enm|dragen|t=to drag, pull, push, draw (out), go to, make, add, etc.}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=drauen|pos=v|id=MED12537}}</ref> from {{inh|en|ang|dragan}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*dragan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*draganą}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰregʰ-|t=to draw, pull}}. {{doublet|en|drag|draught}}.

