{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[result]] of a [[contest]] that neither side [[win|has won]]; a [[tie]].
#: {{ux|en|The game ended in a '''draw'''.}}
# The [[procedure]] by which the [[result]] of a [[lottery]] is [[determine]]d.
#: {{ux|en|The '''draw''' is on Saturday.}}
